              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.27.40"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mainh 27:40",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mu biseera bya Yehoramu oyo, Abaedomu baadheemera Buyudaaya, beeteeragho obwakyabazinga obwaibwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Yehoramu n'abaduumizi be, ng'ali ghalala n'ebigaali bye eby'omu lutalo byonabyona, baaja baalumba ensi Edomu. Eigye ery'Abaedomu lyabazingiza okubeezunguluza. Agho mwene ghalala n'abaduumizi b'ebigaali bye eby'omu lutalo, baasituka obwire, baasobola okughaguza era baaja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale Abaedomu batyo bwe baadheemera Buyudaaya ni ye buli eno. Era mu biseera byene ebyo, n'ab'omu kibuga Libuna boona baadheemera Yehoramu oyo, olw'okuba yava ku Musengwa Katonda, Katonda wa badhaadha be. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ate n'ekindi, yazimba ebifo ebigulumivu eby'okusinzizaamu ku biketezo bya Buyudaaya eby'oku nsozi, yaaleetera abantu ab'omu Yerusalemu n'ab'omu Buyudaaya boonaboona, okwonoona eri Musengwa Katonda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho omulanzi Eliya yaagheereza Yeroboamu embaluwa ng'ekoba eti: “Musengwa Katonda, Katonda wa dhaadha wo Daudi akoba ati, waloba okwebisanga obukalamu nga lata wo Yehoshafati bwe yakolanga, era nga dhaadha wo Asa kyabazinga wa Buyudaaya yeena bwe yakolanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye weebisanga bubi nga bakyabazinga ba Isiraeli bwe baakolanga, waaleetera abantu b'omu Yerusalemu n'ab'omu Buyudaaya boonaboona okuva ku Musengwa Katonda, ng'oti ni Ahabu n'ab'endhu ye bwe baaleetera Abaisiraeli okuva ku Musengwa Katonda oyo. Era okwo waayongeraku n'eky'okwita baganda bo, abaana ba lata wo mwene, abaali abantu abakalamu okusinga n'iwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale ni bona eno, Musengwa Katonda aidha kuleeta endwaire embi einho egeme abantu bo, n'abaana bo, ni bakazi bo, era aidha kuzikiriza n'ebintu byo byonabyona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'iwe mwene weena oidha kulwala endwaire enkakali ey'omu byenda, erikuleetera ebyenda okukufulumanga buli lunaku aghazira kulekeraku naire.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era Musengwa Katonda yaasiikuula obusungu bw'Abafilisiti n'obw'Abawarabu abaalinga nga baba kumpi n'Abaethiopia, yaabaleetamu omwoyo ogw'okulwanisa Yehoramu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baalumba ensi Buyudaaya baagighangula, baanhaga ebintu byonabyona mu kisaagaati kya kyabazinga. Baanhaga ni bakazi be, n'abaana be boonaboona, okutoolaku Yehoahazi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21:17",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Yehoahazi:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Era n'omulala oyo ayetebwa Ahazia.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " omwana we omulenzi nkoma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebyo byonabyona nga bimaze okubaagho, Musengwa Katonda yaaleetera Yehoramu oyo okulwala endwaire ey'omu byenda etawona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe ghaabitagho entangama ya myaka ebiri, ebyenda byamufuluma mu nda olw'endwaire eyo, yaafiira mu bulumi obutaloodheka. Abantu be baaloba okumukumira ekisiki eky'omuliro okumulira, nga bwe kyakolebwanga ku badhaadha be. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yatoolera okufuga ng'agheza emyaka amakumi asatu n'ebiri egy'obukulu, era yaafugira entangama ya myaka munaana mu Yerusalemu. Bwe yafa, ghazira muntu waire omulala ati eyawulira mule ng'amusaire. Agho baamuziika mu kyetebwa Ekibuga kya Daudi, aye ti mu lwambiidhi lwe baazikangamu bakyabazinga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
